### Blob containers

| Container | Access | Purpose | Lifecycle rules |
|---|---|---|---|
| `raw-uploads` | private | **Canonical archive (D28) — kids' original uploads, kept indefinitely.** Soft-delete + versioning on. | **NONE of the deletion class, ever (D28 hard guardrail).** Tier-transition rules (Hot→Cool→Archive) allowed if added later. |
| `finished` | private | Transcoded output (Opus/AAC per D9). Derivative — regeneratable from `raw-uploads` if needed. Soft-delete + versioning on. | None at Sprint 1.3. Tier-transition rules allowed later. |
| `table-backups` | private | Destination for Sprint 4.4's nightly Table export per D33. Empty at Sprint 1.3. | **Optional 30-day auto-prune rule** added at Sprint 4.4 when content starts landing. Backup-pruning is fundamentally different from the D28 ban on `raw-uploads` (pruning backups vs. deleting originals). |

